Design Notification System

1. Requirements
	Functional requirements
		- Support multiple channels: Email, SMS, Push and In-app.
		- Support transactional, promotional and system notifications.
		- Schedule notifications for future delivery.
		- User preferences: Opt-in / Opt-out.
		- Rate limiting to prevent notification spam.
		- Retry failed notifications.
		- Track notification delivery status.
	Non-functional requirements
		- High scalability: Millions of notifications per minute.
		- High availability.
		- Reliable delivery (at-least-once).
		- Low delivery latency.
		- Fault tolerance and independent channel scaling.
	
2. Capacity estimation
	Metric				Estimate
	
	Daily active users		50 million
	Notifications/user/day		5
	Notifications/day		250 million
	Peak notifications/minute	1 million
	Peak throughput			~17,000/sec
	Average notification size	1 KB
	Daily notification storage	250 GB

	Important: Notification systems are write-heavy and experience sudden traffic spikes during sales, OTP requests and major events.
